<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Nov 29.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Nov 29.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 2890.50, 19.48 points or 0.68 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
